- ### 💬 Slack
- **Credentials needed:** App Token (`xapp-...`) + Bot Token (`xoxb-...`)
- Steps to get tokens:
- 1. Go to https://api.slack.com/apps → Create New App
- 2. Enable **Socket Mode** → generate App Token (`connections:write` scope) → copy `xapp-...`
- 3. OAuth & Permissions → install app → copy Bot Token `xoxb-...`
-     "channel": "slack",
- ### 🪁 Feishu / Lark
