- Steps to get credentials:
- 1. Go to https://open.feishu.cn/app (or https://open.larksuite.com/app for Lark)
- 2. Create Enterprise App → copy App ID and App Secret
- 3. Enable **Bot** capability
- 4. Subscribe events: `im.message.receive_v1`
- 5. Enable WebSocket event subscription
